{"id":"n24628-1-6","stage":2,"title":"좁히다 · 使减小","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n24628-1-6-1","ko":"사무실에 휴게실이 하나 있으면 좋겠어요.","zh":"要是办公室里有个休息室的话就太好了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"사무실에","meaning":"办公室","explanation":"사무실：办公室；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"사무실","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61202","senseId":"1","lemma":"사무실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사무실에","audio":"/audio/2a2702038caabbddf12f.mp3"}},{"text":"휴게실이","meaning":"休息室","explanation":"휴게실：休息室；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"휴게실","audio":"/audio/f990f37c3024caa0b4db.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88410","senseId":"1","lemma":"휴게실","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"휴게실이","audio":"/audio/8bf683d5c387e3e63f67.mp3"}},{"text":"하나","meaning":"一","explanation":"하나：一","readings":[{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20279","senseId":"1","lemma":"하나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나","audio":"/audio/556dcbf069a950eb94f3.mp3"}},{"text":"있으면","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"1","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으면","audio":"/audio/909011195908a586359d.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠어요.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠어요","audio":"/audio/3b8ae824a2c33a5f4527.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"e94254252a6c5131","term":"사무실","zh":"办公室","audio":"/audio/e94254252a6c513183a9.mp3","entryId":"61202","definition":"职场中主要用于各自处理文件等业务的房间。","pronunciation"